      "seed": 60031,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 60032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "PILLAR 1: AUTHENTICATION (30%)\n==============================\n\u26a1 STEP 4: Crypto Auth Check\n   (@mailiac/scoring-auth)\n\nUnder the hood:\n\u2022 SPF: Query DNS SPF vs Origin IP\n\u2022 DKIM: Verify RSA Public Key\n\u2022 DMARC: Align From vs SPF/DKIM\n\u2022 ARC: Check Forwarding Chain Seals\n==============================\nOutput: authScore (0 - 100)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p1_under_hood",
      "originalText": "PILLAR 1: AUTHENTICATION (30%)\n==============================\n\u26a1 STEP 4: Crypto Auth Check\n   (@mailiac/scoring-auth)\n\nUnder the hood:\n\u2022 SPF: Query DNS SPF vs Origin IP\n\u2022 DKIM: Verify RSA Public Key\n\u2022 DMARC: Align From vs SPF/DKIM\n\u2022 ARC: Check Forwarding Chain Seals\n==============================\nOutput: authScore (0 - 100)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
