      "seed": 60039,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 60040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "PILLAR 3: IP REPUTATION (20%)\n==============================\n\u26a1 STEP 5: GeoIP & IP Enrich\n   (@mailiac/scoring-ip-reputation)\n\nUnder the hood:\n\u2022 Origin IP Isolation from Hop Trace\n\u2022 AbuseIPDB Threat Confidence Score\n\u2022 Proxy / VPN / TOR Anonymizer Check\n\u2022 Timezone Discrepancy (Header vs Geo)\n==============================\nOutput: ipScore (0 - 100)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "p3_under_hood",
      "originalText": "PILLAR 3: IP REPUTATION (20%)\n==============================\n\u26a1 STEP 5: GeoIP & IP Enrich\n   (@mailiac/scoring-ip-reputation)\n\nUnder the hood:\n\u2022 Origin IP Isolation from Hop Trace\n\u2022 AbuseIPDB Threat Confidence Score\n\u2022 Proxy / VPN / TOR Anonymizer Check\n\u2022 Timezone Discrepancy (Header vs Geo)\n==============================\nOutput: ipScore (0 - 100)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
