      "text": "PILLAR 4: AI INTENT ANALYSIS (25%)\n==============================\n\u26a1 STEP 6: HTML De-cloaking\n   Strip CSS hidden text & zero-width\n\u26a1 STEP 7: AI Threat Classification\n   (@mailiac/parsing-ai-intent)\n   Gemini LLM / Local NLP Model for\n   BEC Financial Urgency & Phishing\n==============================\nOutput: nlpScore (0 - 100)",
