      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "\u26a1 STEP 8: 4-Pillars Risk Engine (@mailiac/scoring-risk-engine)\n\u2022 BaseScore = (0.30\u00d7Auth) + (0.25\u00d7Identity) + (0.20\u00d7IP) + (0.25\u00d7NLP)\n\u2022 Corroboration Bonus (+10 / +20 / +30) + Tier 1 Quarantine Circuit Breaker\n\u2022 FinalScore = min(100, BaseScore + Bonus) | Override = 100",
